# CUTLASS CUP: a rolling strike up or down curves the ball; and a whole
# CPU-against-CPU match keeps on scoring.
game cutlass
wait 5
cheat match 0 1
cheat cpu 1 0
wait 2
cheat play
cheat pos 0 50 100
cheat ball 70 92 0 0
hold UP
press A 1
press B 1
release UP
wait 4
expect ball_curve == 1
cheat match 3 5
cheat demo
wait 5400
expect points >= 4
